        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-FPGA-BEYOND-910.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-910-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH911-PMC-SYSMON-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH912-SMU-CRYPTO-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH913-ICAP-DFX-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH914-SERDES-DFI-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
